sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant Sub as Submission Service
  participant Eng as Analysis Engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>G: Submit artifact or report
  G->>Sub: Validate and create submission
  Sub->>DB: Store submission metadata
  Sub->>Eng: Trigger analysis workflow
  Eng->>DB: Store analysis output
  U->>G: Query result
  G->>DB: Read aggregated status
  G-->>U: Verdict and confidence
